# The scripts write their LaTeX output into tables/ and figures/.  Those are
# inputs to the manuscript, which is not part of this repository, so they are
# regenerated rather than tracked.
tables/*
figures/*
!tables/.gitkeep
!figures/.gitkeep

# results/ IS tracked: it is the raw output of the four Monte Carlo
# studies, which take hours, and it is the record of the run the paper
# reports.  Nothing reads it back.  See README.md.

# Stray output from interactive R sessions or LaTeX runs inside this folder.
# This repository holds code only: it tracks no figure and no document, so any
# pdf or eps here is a leftover, not something to publish.
*.pdf
*.eps

# Backups and archives of earlier runs.  results/ itself IS tracked; a zip of
# it is a private snapshot and does not belong in the repository.
*.zip

# R and LaTeX leftovers
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
